RGate is an independent Rust/GPUI reimplementation inspired by TkGate.
RGate application code is licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later; see LICENSE.
It is not an official TkGate release and is distributed without warranty.

TkGate-derived Classic artwork
------------------------------
Classic gate silhouettes and colored control illustrations were recreated as
vectors using TkGate images as reference. They are not claimed to be wholly
independent artwork. Original reference artwork: copyright Jeffery P. Hansen
and TkGate contributors, GPL-2.0-or-later. RGate's adaptations are distributed
under GPL-3.0-or-later. The refreshed documentation screenshots show those
adaptations wherever Classic artwork is visible.
Source reference: https://github.com/bnoordhuis/tkgate
Revision: 856c40542d3ee5ab0c23cb86a2a4ca0ba623619f
License: licenses/TKGATE-GPL-2.0-or-later
Original bitmap/source/example/logo files are no longer bundled. The RGate
application mark and macOS icon are original RGate artwork.

