Distribution license inventory
------------------------------
Build helpers generate THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt and
THIRD-PARTY-PACKAGES.json from the resolved Cargo metadata, including license
expressions, source locations, and available packaged license/notice texts.
Packages without a packaged license text are identified explicitly; their
manifest and README are included for review. This inventory is not a legal
opinion or a substitute for reviewing notices in native/transitive sources.
GPL distribution must also provide corresponding source and build materials;
a binary plus license texts alone does not satisfy that obligation.
